      "content": "you keep saying it's a gift but it doesn't feel like one. it just feels like a burden. like, if someone just drifted away, no one would even have to stop what they're doing to mourn. wouldn't that be a kind of peace? just fading out so nobody has to deal with the mess of a person who can't keep up anymore?",
